        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>高考语文答题技巧汇总</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #eef7f5;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background:\n      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, #e6f4f1 0px, #e6f4f1 26px, #dfeeeb 26px, #dfeeeb 27px);\n    padding: 18px 16px 24px 16px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .title-bar {\n    background: #4a9fe0;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 27px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 10px 0 12px 0;\n    margin: 0 0 26px 0;\n  }\n  .block { line-height: 1.75; }\n  p { margin: 0; }\n  .blue    { color: #1d5fd0; }\n  .green   { color: #1f9a5a; }\n  .teal    { color: #159c9c; }\n  .plain   { color: #222222; }\n  .indent1 { margin-left: 14px; }\n  .indent2 { margin-left: 24px; }\n  .gap-s   { height: 10px; }\n  .gap-m   { height: 24px; }\n  .gap-l   { height: 34px; }\n  .head-green { color: #1f9a5a; font-weight: 700; margin-left: 14px; }\n  .head-teal  { color: #159c9c; font-weight: 700; margin-left: 24px; }\n  .sub-blue   { color: #1d5fd0; font-weight: 700; margin-left: 24px; }\n  .sub-teal   { color: #159c9c; margin-left: 24px; }\n  .fs { font-size: 15px; }\n\n  /* Watermarks / decorative stickers */\n  .placeholder {\n    position: absolute;\n    color: #b9d8d3;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .wm { width: 110px; height: 26px; }\n  .sticker { width: 40px; height: 40px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title-bar\">高考语文答题技巧汇总</div>\n\n  <!-- Decorative watermark / sticker placeholders -->\n  <figure class=\"placeholder wm\" style=\"left:200px; top:90px; margin:0;\">[Watermark: 升本哆啦君]</figure>\n  <figure class=\"placeholder sticker\" style=\"left:172px; top:82px; margin:0;\">[Sticker]</figure>\n  <figure class=\"placeholder wm\" style=\"left:400px; top:90px; margin:0;\">[Watermark: 升本哆啦君]</figure>\n  <figure class=\"placeholder sticker\" style=\"left:372px; top:82px; margin:0;\">[Sticker]</figure>\n  <figure class=\"placeholder wm\" style=\"left:330px; top:222px; margin:0;\">[Watermark: 升本哆啦君]</figure>\n  <figure class=\"placeholder sticker\" style=\"left:302px; top:214px; margin:0;\">[Sticker]</figure>\n  <figure class=\"placeholder wm\" style=\"left:0px; top:430px; margin:0;\">[Watermark: 哆啦君]</figure>\n  <figure class=\"placeholder wm\" style=\"left:340px; top:430px; margin:0;\">[Watermark: 升本哆啦君]</figure>\n  <figure class=\"placeholder sticker\" style=\"left:312px; top:422px; margin:0;\">[Sticker]</figure>\n  <figure class=\"placeholder wm\" style=\"left:150px; top:545px; margin:0;\">[Watermark: 升本哆啦君]</figure>\n  <figure class=\"placeholder sticker\" style=\"left:122px; top:537px; margin:0;\">[Sticker]</figure>\n  <figure class=\"placeholder wm\" style=\"left:410px; top:545px; margin:0;\">[Watermark: 升本哆啦君]</figure>\n  <figure class=\"placeholder sticker\" style=\"left:382px; top:537px; margin:0;\">[Sticker]</figure>\n  <figure class=\"placeholder sticker\" style=\"right:6px; bottom:6px; margin:0;\">[Logo: 升本哆啦君]</figure>\n\n  <div class=\"block fs\">\n    <p class=\"blue\">分类别：条理清晰</p>\n    <p class=\"blue\">下定义：科学准确</p>\n    <p class=\"blue\">引用：更具体</p>\n\n    <div class=\"gap-l\"></div>\n\n    <p class=\"head-green\">议论文阅读</p>\n    <p class=\"head-teal\">论证方法</p>\n    <p class=\"plain\">1举例论证：具体有力</p>\n    <p class=\"plain\">2、道理论证：具有权威性</p>\n    <p class=\"plain\">3、比喻论证：生动形象</p>\n    <p class=\"plain\">4、对比论证：全面深刻</p>\n    <p class=\"head-teal\">句子作用是</p>\n    <p class=\"plain indent1\">（1）总领全文【在开头】（2）承上启下（3）引出下文（4）提纲挈领<br>【在最后】</p>\n\n    <div class=\"gap-l\"></div>\n\n    <p class=\"head-green\">小说</p>\n    <p class=\"head-teal\">小说三要素</p>\n    <p class=\"sub-teal\">（一）人物形象</p>\n    <p class=\"plain indent1\">1、人物描写角度</p>\n    <p class=\"plain indent1\">（1）、正面描写（直接）：外貌、语言、动作、心理、细节</p>\n    <p class=\"plain indent1\">（2）、侧面描写（间接）：借助他人对比、衬托;借助物象、环境衬托</p>\n    <p class=\"sub-blue\">2、人物描写作用</p>\n    <p class=\"plain indent1\">（1）、外貌动作：更好的展现人物的内心及性格特征;</p>\n    <p class=\"plain indent1\">（2）、语言：刻画人物性格，反应人物心理，促进故事情节发展。</p>\n    <p class=\"plain\">描摹人物语态，使形象刻画栩栩如生，跃然纸上。</p>\n    <p class=\"plain indent1\">（3）、心理：直接表现人物思想和内在情感（矛盾、焦虑、担心、喜悦、<br>兴奋）表现人物思想品质，推动故事情节发展。</p>\n    <p class=\"plain indent1\">（4）、细节：刻画人物形象、深化主题、推动故事情节发展、渲染时代气<br>氛，地方特色、渲染人物心情，心理活动。</p>\n    <p class=\"plain indent1\">（5)侧面：引发读者联想、想象、含蓄曲折地表现人物。</p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
